#tr.ts: ullānum zittīšunu ṭuppum ṣiḫtum
#tr.en: Apart from (the tablet of) their share, any fraudolent tablet

11. sza i-na qa2-ti-szu-nu i-li-a-am 
#tr.ts: ša ina qātīšunu i(l)liam			
